  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\r\n\r\nStep 11.5 in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/popover.html#show-popover can throw an exception, this happens regardless of the throwExceptions argument to the algorithm.\r\n\r\nIs this intentional or should it be changed to just return when throwExceptions is false?\r\n\r\nIn case the number changes 11.5 is If originalType is not equal to the value of element's [popover](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/popover.html#attr-popover) attribute, then throw a [\"InvalidStateError\"](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror) [DOMException](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException).",
